        "original_id": "2976662c-8259-52dd-877f-66e08a3a667b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Malkovich, John Dahl, Matt Damon, Edward Norton, David Zayas, Patricia Arquette, Domenick Lombardozzi, Michael Imperioli, Vincent Piazza, Nick Sandow\n- Films: Rounders, Empire of the Sun, The Killing Fields, Con Air, Of Mice and Men, Ripley's Game, Knockaround Guys, Being John Malkovich, Shadow of the Vampire, Burn After Reading, RED, Mulholland Falls, Dangerous Liaisons, Warm Bodies, Ghost World, Juno, The Perks of Being a Wallflower, The Wannabe\n- TV Series: Dexter, Oz, Gotham, Annie\n- Roles: Angel Batista, Osborne the cop, Enrique Morales, Lou the bodega owner, Sal Maroni\n\nFacts:\n- John Malkovich has appeared in films including Empire of the Sun, The Killing Fields, Con Air, Of Mice and Men, Rounders, Ripley's Game, Knockaround Guys, Being John Malkovich, Shadow of the Vampire, Burn After Reading, RED, Mulholland Falls, Dangerous Liaisons, and Warm Bodies.\n- John Malkovich has also produced the films Ghost World, Juno, and The Perks of Being a Wallflower.\n- Rounders is a 1998 American drama film about the underground world of high-stakes poker.\n- Rounders was directed by John Dahl and starred Matt Damon and Edward Norton.\n- David Zayas played Osborne the cop in Rounders (1998).\n- David Zayas is best known for playing Angel Batista on Dexter, Enrique Morales on Oz, Lou the bodega owner in Annie (2014), and Sal Maroni on Gotham.\n- The Wannabe stars Patricia Arquette, David Zayas, Domenick Lombardozzi, Michael Imperioli, Vincent Piazza, and Nick Sandow.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
